      "writtenOn": "2018-05-14T07:05:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this method only use in this file? If so, mark it as private.\n\nI think we should return 0 when the empty string is given. This mean empty types can\u0027t support any type, because I don\u0027t think it\u0027s a good idea to make the empty string to support all the types. Can we also make a comment for this behavior?\n\nThe ApnEditor already converted empty string to all but ia, emergency, read only type. \n\nhere is the reference: https://cs.corp.google.com/android/packages/apps/Settings/src/com/android/settings/network/ApnEditor.java?q\u003dApnEditor\u0026dr\u003dCSs\u0026l\u003d1138",
      "parentUuid": "026bcb3a_837538c1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1092,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 1094,
        "endChar": 28
